to:
promote good corporate governance in Southern Africa by empowering those who are charged with governance duties to effectively and legally discharge those duties;
safeguard the integrity and status of directorship as a profession by serving as the professional body for directors and through the provision of a professional designation which serves to assess and credit mastery;
